<title>INDIA: India Mar 21 t-bill auction to raise 1 bln rupees.</title>
<headline>India Mar 21 t-bill auction to raise 1 bln rupees.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India said on Monday the notified amount to be raised at the 91-day treasury bills auction on March 21 would be one billion rupees against the normal five billion.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
